@startuml AI_RSS_08_Analysis_Status_State
title AI增强RSS阅读器 - 08 AI 分析状态机

skinparam backgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #334155
  FontColor #0F172A
  StartColor #16A34A
  EndColor #DC2626
}

state pending #E2E8F0
state queued #FEF3C7
state processing #DBEAFE
state completed #DCFCE7
state failed #FEE2E2

[*] --> pending : 文章抓取并入库
pending --> queued : 用户点击 analyze
queued --> processing : db_worker 领取任务
processing --> completed : 三层 JSON 全部写入
processing --> failed : 模型错误 / JSON 无效 / 入库失败
failed --> queued : 用户重试 reanalyze
completed --> queued : 用户手动 reanalyze
completed --> [*]

note right of pending
pending 表示：
文章可读，但尚未请求 AI 分析。
end note

note right of completed
completed 必须满足：
structured_result 非空
cognitive_result 非空
decision_result 非空
end note

note right of failed
failed 必须保留：
error_message
task_id
updated_at
end note

@enduml
